OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine and
OL,6,Fpleasantly warm end to Friday with
OL,7,Fplenty of evening sunshine, though a
OL,8,Fsmall chance of a shower in Essex and
OL,9,FSuffolk overnight. Otherwise staying
OL,10,Fdry with long clear periods. A more
OL,11,Fcomfortable night for sleeping.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FOften sunny, though some
OL,14,Fwispy high cloud is possible. An
OL,15,Fisolated shower is possible in Essex.
OL,16,FLight winds with sea breezes
OL,17,Fdeveloping. Feeling warm, though much
OL,18,Fless hot than recently.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
