OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FFine
OL,6,Fand very warm on Sunday with plenty of
OL,7,Fhazy sunshine. Another very warm or
OL,8,Fhot spell early next week with an
OL,9,Fincreasing chance of scattered showers
OL,10,Fand local thunderstorms.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
